2. What is prohibited

   Without prior written permission from Bobine, you may not:

   a) copy, reproduce or download the Site, in whole or in part, beyond what is
      strictly necessary to read it;
   b) use the Site: run it, build it, deploy it, host it, put it online,
      integrate it into another project or derive a service from it;
   c) modify, adapt, translate or create a derivative work of the Site;
   d) distribute, publish, communicate to the public, lend, rent, sell or
      sublicense the Site, in whole or in part;
   e) reuse the name, visual identity, texts, structure or design of the Site
      for another site or product, or create confusion with Bobine or
      bobine.fit;
   f) remove or alter copyright and ownership notices.

   Making a copy available to others is not permitted, even free of charge.

3. GitHub terms of service

   The rights that GitHub's terms of service grant to users of the platform
